{"seq":2,"slug":"security","title":"安全与认证授权","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"authentication-at-gateway","title":"网关层认证机制：集中化身份验证的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authentication-at-gateway","wordCount":773,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"authorization-access-control","title":"授权与访问控制：网关如何决定\"能做什么\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authorization-access-control","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"tls-certificate-management","title":"TLS 终止与证书管理：网关的 HTTPS 安全基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/tls-certificate-management","wordCount":853,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"安全与认证授权\">安全与认证授权</h1><p>本章专注于网关层的安全实现。三篇文档分别覆盖：客户端身份验证（<a href=\"authentication-at-gateway\">网关层认证机制</a>）、基于身份的访问控制决策（<a href=\"authorization-access-control\">授权与访问控制</a>）、以及 TLS 证书管理与终止（<a href=\"tls-certificate-management\">TLS 终止与证书管理</a>）。</p>\n<p>安全在网关层集中处理的核心价值是：消除每个微服务重复实现安全逻辑的风险，确保无论从哪个入口进入的请求都经过统一的安全检查。</p>\n"}